---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/Container.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Digital Divide handles your personal information."
>
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <Container narrow>
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">Last updated: January 2025</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p>
          Your privacy matters to us. This policy explains what information we
          collect and how we use it.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

        <h3>Newsletter Subscription</h3>
        <p>
          When you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address.
          This information is stored with our email service provider, MailerLite,
          and is used solely to send you our newsletter.
        </p>

        <h3>Analytics</h3>
        <p>
          We use privacy-focused analytics to understand how visitors use our
          site. This may include information like pages visited, time on site,
          and general geographic location (country level). We do not track
          individual users or use cookies for analytics purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Send you our newsletter (if you've subscribed)</li>
          <li>Understand how our site is used so we can improve it</li>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries if you contact us</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What We Don't Do</h2>
        <p>We do not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Sell your personal information</li>
          <li>Share your email with third parties (except our email provider)</li>
          <li>Use tracking cookies or fingerprinting</li>
          <li>Display personalized advertising</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          We use the following third-party services that may collect data:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>MailerLite</strong> — For newsletter management.
            <a href="https://www.mailerlite.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              View their privacy policy
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Unsubscribe</strong> from our newsletter at any time using
            the link in any email
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Request deletion</strong> of your personal data by
            contacting us
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Request access</strong> to the personal data we hold about
            you
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this privacy policy or your personal data,
          please contact us at
          <a href="mailto:privacy@digitaldivide.com">privacy@digitaldivide.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. Significant changes will
          be announced via our newsletter or on this page.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
